5_Project_History/backups/

# Kam's chat log is DERIVED from the per-agent streams (Phase 0, 2026-09-08).
# Tracking a generated file that two seats both regenerate is what corrupted it
# three times in one morning. The RECORD is tracked — chat_legacy.json (frozen)
# plus one stream per writer; this file is rebuilt by tools/chat_streams.py at
# every append, at every safe_push, and at every boot by doctor.sh.
0_Brain/dashboard/data/chat_log.json

# Files Kam drags into the chat (2026-09-08). His working material — screenshots,
# PDFs, exports — not repo content, and some of it is large. Gitignored AT CREATION.
# The chat entry keeps the absolute path, so Wednesday reads them from disk; they
# are not recoverable from git and are not meant to be.
0_Brain/dashboard/uploads/

# statusline_publish.sh diagnostics (per-seat, machine-local)
2_Project_Files/logs/

# usage_*.json IS tracked, deliberately. It was ignored for eleven minutes on the
# reasoning that it is live machine-local state - which was wrong about the one thing
# that matters: Tuesday's seat is on another machine and THIS REPO IS THE TRANSPORT
# between the two seats (her commit landed here by git while that line was being
# written). Ignoring it would have guaranteed her chip stayed empty forever. The churn
# that motivated ignoring it is fixed at the writer instead: statusline_publish.sh now
# writes only when the number moves or the file ages past its heartbeat.

# LEDGER .pre-* backups only, and the narrowing is deliberate.
# A blanket `*.pre-*` was written here first and then withdrawn: `git ls-files`
# shows 72 tracked .pre-* files, so tracking script backups is ESTABLISHED
# PRACTICE, not an accident, and a blanket rule would have silently changed it
# for every future one (2026-09-07_a-rule-for-creation-is-not-a-mandate-to-retrofit
# - before reshaping anything, find what already occupies the slot).
# The ledger pair is the case that genuinely differs: 1.2 MB per archive run,
# several runs a week, and git already holds every one of those rows in history.
# The files stay on disk - never delete, only quarantine.
0_Brain/learnings/_ledger.md.pre-*
0_Brain/learnings/_ledger_archive.md.pre-*

# Data-store backups taken before an in-place retag/repair (gitignore-at-creation, Tuesday 2026-09-09)
0_Brain/dashboard/data/*.pre-*

# panel_sync run log (machine-local)
2_Project_Files/tools/logs/

# dashboard run output (2026-09-10: created when serve.sh was restarted by hand)
2_Project_Files/dashboard/serve.log

# Agent stdout captured at launch — artifacts, not deliverables. Gitignored AT CREATION
# (2026-08-04 lesson) and specifically because an untracked file outside dashboard/data
# blocks panel_sync, which is what stalled Kam's chat for 42 minutes on 2026-09-10.
2_Project_Files/fleet/briefs_staged/*.out
